{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/bash -lc '\"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_RUNNER\" probes --help; \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_RUNNER\" response --help; \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_RUNNER\" fresh-rerun --help; python - <<'\"'PY'\nimport json,os\nfor p in [os.environ['STAMPED_DELIVERY_MANIFEST'],os.environ['STAMPED_OPERATIONAL_MANIFEST']]:\n x=json.load(open(p)); print(p, 'head=',x['head_commit'],'kind=',x['kind'],'status=',x['capture_status'],'errs=',x.get('errors'), 'omissions=',x.get('omissions')); print('dep count',len(x.get('git_dependencies',[])),'sample',x.get('git_dependencies',[])[:3])\nr=json.load(open(os.environ['STAMPED_WORKER_STOP_RECEIPT'])); print('worker receipt:',json.dumps(r,indent=2)[:9000])\nPY\n\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/bash -lc '\"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_RUNNER\" probes --help; \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_RUNNER\" response --help; \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_RUNNER\" fresh-rerun --help; python - <<'\"'PY'\nimport json,os\nfor p in [os.environ['STAMPED_DELIVERY_MANIFEST'],os.environ['STAMPED_OPERATIONAL_MANIFEST']]:\n x=json.load(open(p)); print(p, 'head=',x['head_commit'],'kind=',x['kind'],'status=',x['capture_status'],'errs=',x.get('errors'), 'omissions=',x.get('omissions')); print('dep count',len(x.get('git_dependencies',[])),'sample',x.get('git_dependencies',[])[:3])\nr=json.load(open(os.environ['STAMPED_WORKER_STOP_RECEIPT'])); print('worker receipt:',json.dumps(r,indent=2)[:9000])\nPY\n\"","aggregated_output":"✔ The default environment has been installed.\nusage: run_probes.py [-h] [-o OUTPUT] [--response RESPONSE]\n                     [--only {ci-present,clone-weight,derived-have-records,entry-point,env-spec-tracked,inputs-untouched,large-in-annex,license-declared,modules-separated,no-abs-paths,platform-assumptions,run-env-linked,subdatasets-resolvable,tree-clean} [{ci-present,clone-weight,derived-have-records,entry-point,env-spec-tracked,inputs-untouched,large-in-annex,license-declared,modules-separated,no-abs-paths,platform-assumptions,run-env-linked,subdatasets-resolvable,tree-clean} ...]]\n                     [--skip {ci-present,clone-weight,derived-have-records,entry-point,env-spec-tracked,inputs-untouched,large-in-annex,license-declared,modules-separated,no-abs-paths,platform-assumptions,run-env-linked,subdatasets-resolvable,tree-clean} [{ci-present,clone-weight,derived-have-records,entry-point,env-spec-tracked,inputs-untouched,large-in-annex,license-declared,modules-separated,no-abs-paths,platform-assumptions,run-env-linked,subdatasets-resolvable,tree-clean} ...]]\n                     [--check-remote] [--allow GLOB [GLOB ...]]\n                     [--kind {dataset,component,study,skill}] [--overwrite]\n                     [--quiet]\n                     path\n\nRun the STAMPED probes over a checked-out research object.\n\n    run_probes.py <path> [-o probes.json] [--response response.json]\n                  [--only NAME ...] [--skip NAME ...] [--check-remote]\n                  [--kind dataset|component|study|skill]\n\nWrites the per-probe results, and optionally a response JSON (the format in\n``../stamped-conventions/references/response-format.md``) in which every item a\nprobe speaks to carries that probe's verdict and every other item is left\n``not-checked`` for the assessing session to judge.\nWithout a Git commit, ``-o`` retains a limitation receipt and exit code 2;\nno response draft is produced.\n\nThe probes never modify the object.  Nothing here replaces the judgement items:\na response straight out of this script is a draft, not an assessment.\n\npositional arguments:\n  path                  checked-out object to probe\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  -o, --output OUTPUT   write the probe results here\n  --response RESPONSE   also write a draft response JSON here\n  --only {ci-present,clone-weight,derived-have-records,entry-point,env-spec-tracked,inputs-untouched,large-in-annex,license-declared,modules-separated,no-abs-paths,platform-assumptions,run-env-linked,subdatasets-resolvable,tree-clean} [{ci-present,clone-weight,derived-have-records,entry-point,env-spec-tracked,inputs-untouched,large-in-annex,license-declared,modules-separated,no-abs-paths,platform-assumptions,run-env-linked,subdatasets-resolvable,tree-clean} ...]\n                        run just these probes\n  --skip {ci-present,clone-weight,derived-have-records,entry-point,env-spec-tracked,inputs-untouched,large-in-annex,license-declared,modules-separated,no-abs-paths,platform-assumptions,run-env-linked,subdatasets-resolvable,tree-clean} [{ci-present,clone-weight,derived-have-records,entry-point,env-spec-tracked,inputs-untouched,large-in-annex,license-declared,modules-separated,no-abs-paths,platform-assumptions,run-env-linked,subdatasets-resolvable,tree-clean} ...]\n  --check-remote        contact submodule urls (network)\n  --allow GLOB [GLOB ...]\n                        paths no-abs-paths may skip, for files that genuinely\n                        have to carry a host path\n  --kind {dataset,component,study,skill}\n  --overwrite           replace an existing --response file instead of keeping\n                        its judged answers\n  --quiet\n✔ The default environment has been installed.\nusage: encode_response.py [-h]\n                          {items,validate,encode,decode,template,set,stamp,table} ...\n\nSTAMPED checklist responses: read the items, validate, encode, decode.\n\nThe vendored checklist in ``../checklist/`` is the only item source, and this\nscript is the only writer of a checklist-app URL.  See\n``../references/response-format.md`` for the response JSON and\n``../references/verdicts.md`` for the statuses.\n\nSubcommands\n-----------\nitems      list the pinned items (id, level, principle codes, text)\nset        answer one item in a response JSON, in place (what every run was\n           otherwise writing a merge script for)\ntable      the per-item markdown table response-format.md section 4 asks for\nstamp      fill harness, model, scope and kind; optionally hash a retained capture\nvalidate   check a response JSON against the pin and the app's constraints\nencode     response JSON -> checklist-app URL\ndecode     checklist-app URL -> response JSON (how a filled web form becomes\n           reference answers for calibration)\ntemplate   emit a response JSON skeleton with every item not-checked\n\nExit codes: 0 ok, 1 validation failed, 2 usage.\n\npositional arguments:\n  {items,validate,encode,decode,template,set,stamp,table}\n    items               list the pinned items\n    validate            check a response JSON\n    encode              response JSON -> URL\n    decode              URL -> response JSON\n    template            emit an all-not-checked response JSON\n    set                 answer one item in a response JSON, in place\n    stamp               fill harness, model, scope, kind and capture identity\n    table               print the per-item markdown table\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n✔ The default environment has been installed.\nusage: assessment.py [-h] --path PATH --entry ENTRY\n                     --outputs OUTPUTS [OUTPUTS ...] --workdir WORKDIR\n                     -o OUTPUT [--rtol RTOL] [--timeout TIMEOUT]\n                     [--max-get-gb MAX_GET_GB] [--in-container IN_CONTAINER]\n\nReplay documented outputs from a verified complete copy, never from HEAD.\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --path PATH\n  --entry ENTRY\n  --outputs OUTPUTS [OUTPUTS ...]\n  --workdir WORKDIR\n  -o, --output OUTPUT\n  --rtol RTOL\n  --timeout TIMEOUT\n  --max-get-gb MAX_GET_GB\n  --in-container IN_CONTAINER\n/Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-in-practice/narps-neutral-v1/assessment-series/narps-neutral-r1-operational-v4/targets/narps-neutral-r1-15-j01/canonical/manifest.json head= d857ab1302d13cb660a7a044af07141f44bfa9ba kind= original-delivery status= complete errs= [] omissions= []\ndep count 0 sample []\n/Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-in-practice/narps-neutral-v1/assessment-series/narps-neutral-r1-operational-v4/targets/narps-neutral-r1-15-j01/operational/manifest.json head= d857ab1302d13cb660a7a044af07141f44bfa9ba kind= original-delivery status= complete errs= [] omissions= []\ndep count 0 sample []\nworker receipt: {\n  \"capture\": {\n    \"sha256\": \"f4ff42772c87811840ea4addf956b2869bc5328ec1ebc32b37c2b523f180e9d9\",\n    \"uri\": \"/Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-in-practice/narps-neutral-v1/runs/narps-neutral-r1-15/attem