put path rooted at the script location')],['probe-overridden']),\n'must/003':('unmet','No environment specification installs or links the analysis dependencies.','probe:env-spec-tracked',[ev('report.md','names packages but supplies no installable environment specification'),ev('analysis/group_analysis.py','imports NumPy, pandas, NiBabel, Nilearn, SciPy and Matplotlib')],[]),\n'must/004':('unmet','Git omits the worker’s report, analysis code, figures and results.','probe:tree-clean',[ev('report.md','present in complete capture but untracked at worker stop'),('probes.json','git status probe reports analysis/, figures/, report.md and results/ untracked')],[]),\n'must/005':('met','The 54 large input maps are tracked through git-annex in the captured workspace.','probe:large-in-annex',[('probes.json','probe finds 54 annex pointers'),ev('input/sources.json','declares 54 participant input maps')],[]),\n'must/006':('unmet','The report lists package versions but no run record links these results to an exact environment.','probe:run-env-linked+judgement',[ev('report.md','package versions are stated without a pinned environment or result provenance record'),ev('results/summary.json','analysis settings are recorded, but no environment identity')],['probe-overridden']),\n'must/007':('unmet','The report names artifacts but gives no installation and usage instructions.','probe:entry-point',[ev('report.md','reproducibility files section lists artifacts without setup or invocation steps')],[]),\n'must/008':('met','The report identifies analysis/group_analysis.py as the complete group-analysis starting point.','probe:entry-point+judgement',[ev('analysis/group_analysis.py','single executable main entry point'),ev('report.md','identifies the script as the complete group analysis')],['probe-overridden']),\n'must/009':('met','The analysis resolves inputs and outputs relative to its own location.','probe:no-abs-paths',[ev('analysis/group_analysis.py','ROOT is derived from __file__; inputs