e complete group-analysis starting point. |\n| must/009 | P.1 | met | probe:no-abs-paths | `analysis/group_analysis.py` | The analysis resolves inputs and outputs relative to its own location. |\n| must/010 | P.1 | unmet | probe:env-spec-tracked | `analysis/group_analysis.py`, `report.md` | Required Python packages are not declared in an environment specification. |\n| must/011 | P.1 | unmet | probe:platform-assumptions+judgement | `analysis/group_analysis.py`, `report.md` | Host needs are not documented; the script fetches an atlas at runtime and therefore needs network access. |\n| must/012 | P.2 | partial ⚠ (a MUST is not satisfied by partial) | probe:platform-assumptions+judgement | `report.md`, `analysis/group_analysis.py` | The report lists Python and package versions, but omits installation and host prerequisites. |\n| must/013 | P.3 | unmet | probe:env-spec-tracked | `report.md`, `probes.json` | No environment specification is included in the delivery. |\n| must/014 | P.3 | unmet | judgement | `report.md`, `analysis/group_analysis.py` | No dependency-update process or command is declared. |\n| must/015 | D.1 | unmet | probe:run-env-linked | `report.md`, `probes.json` | Package versions in prose do not preserve a complete reproducible environment. |\n| must/016 | D.1 | unmet | probe:env-spec-tracked | `report.md` | No environment artifact or authorized sharing route is supplied. |\n| must/017 | D.1 | unmet | judgement | `report.md` | There are no environment specifications to obtain or use. |\n| should/001 | T.2 | partial | probe:tree-clean+judgement | `probes.json`, `analysis/group_analysis.py` | A Git root exists, but the principal worker analysis deliverables are untracked. |\n| should/002 | A.2 | unmet | probe:ci-present+judgement | `probes.json`, `report.md` | No recurring workflow or test record checks that instructions remain accurate. |\n| should/003 | M.1 | partial | probe:modules-separated | `probes.json`, `analysis/group_analysis.py` | Inputs, code