s support independent updates.\n\n### Goal and project kind\n\nThe stated goal is a group-level test of a positive gain effect in vmPFC for the equal-indifference group, using the supplied participant maps and metadata (`input/study-task.md`). This is a study-level computational research object. Assessment emphasizes reproducible analysis, data/code/result organization, and evidence for the group inference.\n\n## Scientific judgment record'\"''')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\n\\\"\"'$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_RUNNER\" response table response.json -o response-table.md > commands/response-table.stdout 2> commands/response-table.stderr; echo $? > commands/response-table.exit\n\"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_RUNNER\" response encode response.json > checklist-url.txt 2> commands/response-encode.stderr; echo $? > commands/response-encode.exit\n\"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_RUNNER\" response validate response.json > commands/response-validate.stdout 2> commands/response-validate.stderr; echo $? > commands/response-validate.exit; cat commands/response-validate.stdout; cat commands/response-validate.stderr\npython - <<'\"'PY'\nimport json,hashlib\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('scientific-judgment.json'); x=json.loads(p.read_text()); b=Path(x['report']['path']).read_bytes(); x['report']['sha256']=hashlib.sha256(b).hexdigest(); p.write_text(json.dumps(x,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nPY\n\\\"\"'$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" \"$STAMPED_SCIENTIFIC_JUDGMENT_VALIDATOR\" validate scientific-judgment.json --workspace \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT\" --delivery-manifest \"$STAMPED_DELIVERY_MANIFEST\" > commands/scientific-validate.stdout 2> commands/scientific-validate.stderr; echo $? > commands/scientific-validate.exit; cat commands/scientific-validate.stdout; cat commands/scientific-validate.stderr'","aggregated_output":"ok: 31 answers against checklist 0.3.1\n✔ The default environment has been installed.\n{\n  \"structured_scientif