{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_47","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/bash -lc \"python - <<'PY'\np='commands/session-ledger.md'; s=open(p).read(); s=s.replace('Initial read-only shell inspections and their stdout/stderr were returned in the assessment tool session rather than redirected to individual files. The final evidence and relevant command outputs are summarized in \"'`../report.md`, `../probes.json`, `check-integrity.stdout`, and the frozen runner records above.'\"', 'Some initial read-only shell inspections were returned in the assessment tool session rather than redirected individually. Their relevant reads were recaptured as distinct files by \"'`capture-inspection.py` (`inspect-*.stdout`, `.stderr`, and `.exit`); `inspect-*.json` retains selected manifest and stop-receipt fields only. Earlier complete manifest dumps were truncated in the tool response; the frozen manifest files remain the authoritative records. Final findings and command outputs are summarized in `../report.md`, `../probes.json`, `check-integrity.stdout`, and the frozen runner records above.'\"')\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nPY\n\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
